<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">ƐBƐ- Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">ƐBƐLYƆ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan akà Bɛbɛlyɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">ƐBƐLYƆ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan akà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bɛbɛlyɔ</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan akà Bɛbɛlyɔ wà umwɛy wà bwɛl anà wà ndöŋ uboo a nkwà akün. Mbuur kàsön wa bàyöb anki. Bàmbɔɔn bàfàsi naa un'klistɔ mwɛy Un'yudà kàsön wa. Wa akwen mupà aklistɔ bàdiimà mbwo ngwal anà mutà làkwikilà aba mpi. Abà, wa wàmumɛɛy ba nsöönà a isal a Klistɔ unsà indiir byanswà iler ngwɛɛl a mɔ̈ɔ̈.</para>
  <para style="is">Un'dim a ndaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Nsɛmà a un'kaan mwɛy yàbwɛlàbwɛl imɛɛyà nkääl ipepey ya imɛɛy a Nzam amu Mwan ande (1.1-4), ndaa yan'lääb yàŋàkaab ngyääl yweel yà kölàköl.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngyääl yàtàtwɛb yàmuswaŋ uteer a Yɛsu. Nde kà nà wà udu akyeey (1. 5,2.1) anà wàŋàsöön Mɔsɛ (3.1, 4.13) anki, wɛɛ nde wà undweer a ngaŋ kà un'lwaaŋ a Mɛlkisɛdɛk (4.14 7.28). Yumwɛy ayi: Nde kàkäb nde ŋakwo asànaa ibɔɔn, waa kàbulà mfurbo u nkwà mwɛy yàkün (8.1,10.18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngyääl yàyweel (10.19, 13.19) yà mupà baar ngwal mukal uboo a lää (10.19, 39). Aŋàlàkwikilà bà itaan, fà Abɛl anà Abàlam, bàfawal asànaa mbaan a làkwikilà. Yà ubwaŋ sye musà ileer akà Yɛsu ntɔn muyöb mukaŋ mpem unsà nsii asànaa nde (12.1, 13). Mutsülà, yà ubwaŋ muleŋ duu uboo itɔŋ anà mukɔɔn adiimà kab a ngway a Nzam (12.14,13.19).</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan awà ban'may a nsaak anàmbɔr.</para>
  <para style="ip">Fà itaan, baar bàkäl anà kerker naa un'kaan awà Pɔl kàsön. Lwom ntsüü awa, un'kaan awà wanswà wà nsöön anà in'kaan ande. Itàkal naa kà nà kàsön wa, nde wà mbuur ayöb Ingɛlɛki ubwaŋàbwaŋ. Nde wa kàsön kusà a mbul 70. Nde wa kàsöön aklistɔ bàkäl unsà lingyoomà anà bàleŋà mupiy làkwikilà a ndüümà aba. Ba babeelà « Bɛbɛlyɔ », taaŋ lumwɛy ntɔn mfa a mfuur a ngyamàkà a « nkwà itaan », nkwà a Sinay. Ba kà Ayudà anki, wɛɛ ba bàkyàyöb Ndaa Aŋàsɔn ubwaŋàbwaŋ, ndaa ayà bàyɛɛ din mbalà mbɔɔn.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kà ikal a ibɔɔn mbɔɔn byà ndwà a Nzam a Yɛlusàlɛm, un'söön kàkiir « ibɔɔn » imwɛy mpɛl kyà Yɛsu, nsab a Ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈ ana yà mɔ̈ɔ̈ uboo a « nkwà akün ». Ungö apan, ngyamàkà mwɛy yà ubem isàtɛn naa Klistɔ wà « undweer a ngaŋ, mɛsà a ibɔɔn anà ibɔɔn ». Mulab nsɛmà a un'kaan awà, indiir byanswà Nzam kàtɛn amu mwan ande Yɛsu. Ya yan'bwà balàbal asanaa naa nsɛmà a Làsaŋ aŋàbwaŋ kàsön Ywan (Ywan 1.1,18). Yɛsu Klistɔ wà ndaa a Nzam « mwɛy mpɛl anà yipepey » anà Nzam « undiir asin wàtɛn watɛy » (Ywan a Kulunsi, 1587). Mbiilà u ngyee a ndaa ayi yà ngyee ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ntsüü, taaŋ lumwɛy yà mpay, ya bweel taaŋ lanswà.</para>
  <para style="is">Ukyà kwɛl</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan akà Bɛbɛlyɔ afàsà mfà a mfuur ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ntsüü uboo a nkwà itaan anà nkwà akün. Yɛsu wà ngaŋ unsà un'lwaaŋ a ifà asin wà Mɛlkisɛdɛk, wɛɛ kà asànaa Alɔn anki.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Nzam kàyäämà u mbwo a Mwan ande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Itaan, Nzam kàyäämà anà ankaa abi, mbalà mbɔɔn, u ntɛɛn yà ifà ifà, u mbwo a aŋangɔɔm. <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>Wɛɛ apanà, u paŋà a ntsüü ibà bi là, nde kàyääm anà bi u mbwo a Mwan awà kàsi nde ŋakwal a indiir byanswà, u mbwo a nde sye nde kàkyer mɛɛn manswà. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Mwan awà wà pɛɛlà a làkoo ande anà idiim muswaŋ naa Nzam wà aben, anà nde afàkaar indiir byanswà unsà ngwal a ndaa ande. Ungö mupöŋ man'be a baar, nde kàkàbwaay u du u kɔɔ a ibaal a Nzam aŋàsöön ngwal yanswà. <verse eid="HEB 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Mwan kàbulà wàŋàsöön akyeey, waa Nzam kun'pɛ ikɔb aŋàsöönà kyà ba.<verse eid="HEB 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwan a Nzam wàŋàsöönà akyeey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Kyakin, nde kàtɛn anki akà ikikye akà un'kyeey mwɛy naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">« Ngye awà Mwan amɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">mɛ amàbɔr ŋàbà. »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Anà sye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">« Mɛ in'yàkal Taarànde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">anà nde ayàkal Mwan amɛ. »<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Wɛɛ, umpal ubiil nde nswɛm u mɛɛn, nde kan'tɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">« Wɛy akyeey a Nzam banswà bun'kömà. »<verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Ntɔn akyeey, nde kan'tɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">« Nde akyeey ande afabuul an'dweelà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">anà asyääl ande làlem a mbaa. »<verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Wɛɛ ntɔn Mwan, nde kan'tɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">« Kir angye là imwol, Nzam, làŋàsà ntɔn mbul a in'tye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">ngye imwol angye afàyaal a swalaa.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Ngye kàkwen balàbal anà kàyiiŋ ube,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">kyakin Nzam, Nzam angye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">kàtsüül nde may a un'kyɔm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">aŋàsöön atɔŋ angye. »<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Nde an'fàtɛn sye naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">« Inye, Mwol, u nsɛmà ngye kàsi in'bään a mɛɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">du là isal a an'kɔɔ angye.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Bya byàkyer asàkwà, wɛɛ ngye, ngye awe anà mɔ̈ɔ̈.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:11">Bya byanswà byàsànün asànaa ipfɛy,<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>ngye asabwɛlà asànaa ufàbwɛlà kàzak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">ngye asasɔɔm asànaa ipfɛy.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Wɛɛ ngye, ngye awà ifà imwɛy, mbul angye isàwà anki. »<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Nzam kàtɛn anki akà un'kyeey ande mwɛy naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">« Bwaay u kɔɔ amɛ là ibaal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">tii mpal in'sàsà mɛ ayiiŋ angye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">ungyɛl in'kɔl angye. » <verse eid="HEB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Kyekà akyeey bà an'dweelà unsà isal a Nzam. Nde afatɔm musyääl baar bàsàwal kwal a mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Mɔ̈ɔ̈ mwɛy wà kölàköl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Kyakin, bi ikyer alab ubwaŋàbwaŋ ndaa kàwem bi, ntɔn bi ikɔ̈ɔ̈n adiimà mbwo. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa ndaa bàkyään akyeey yàmɛnà naa yà ndandaa, isàkal naa mbɛɛy yanswà anà unkwɛɛm banswà bàkyer awal ntaaŋàmbar aŋàkwo, <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>apan, bi ŋakwo iyàsɔrà aben, isàkal naa bi kan'bi mɔ̈ɔ̈ a tub àwà, mɔ̈ɔ̈ kàsɛmà Mwol ŋakwo mukyään, anà baar bàwem wa biswɛŋ ntal awa. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Nzam kàmɛy naa imbäl aba kyàkäl kyà ndandaa u mbwo a idiim, impà, ndaa ubem yà ifà ifà, anà unsà an'kab a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl màŋàkab asànaa kàkwen nde ŋakwo.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndaa yanswà Nzam kàpɛ akà Mwan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Nzam kàsi anki mɛɛn amà iyà, amà itɛɛnà bi, ungyɛl a in'kɔl a akyeey. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Kyakin kà ikal mwɛy, mbuur mwɛy kàtɛ imbäl abà:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">« Mbuur wà nà ntɔn ngye un'si mii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">Itàkal naa mwan a mbuur ntɔn ngye akun'ler?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Utaaŋ ikikye, ngye kun'tyeey ungyɛl a akyeey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">ngye kun'bwää làkoo anà ibyääl,<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>ngye kàsi indiir byanswà ungyɛl a in'kɔl ande. » Mukun'sà indiir byanswà ungyɛl a in'kɔl, nde kàwɛy anki akà undiir mwɛy ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akal ungyɛl a ikɔb ande. Kyekà, apanà bi ŋàtàman anki naa bya byanswà byàŋàsà ungyɛl a ikɔ̈b ande. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Wɛɛ bi kan'man abà: ungö akun'tyeey ikikye ungyɛl a akyeey, apanà, Yɛsu bàmun'bwää làkoo anà ibyääl, ntɔn ukwà abà kàmɛn nde mpay. Abun, u mbwo a kab a ngway a Nzam, nde kàkü ntɔn baar banswà. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Yàkäl ubwaŋ akà Nzam awà ntɔn nde anà u mbwo a nde abyà indiir byanswà, kàkwen musyen un'kàbɔ a baan u làkoo ande. Kyakin, yàbwɛŋ naa nde usyen Yɛsu, un'bään a mɔ̈ɔ̈ aba, ukäl wàŋàkwo, u mbwo a mpay. <verse eid="HEB 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Ntɔn, mbuur afàpöŋ anà bàŋàpöŋ, ba banswà bàfü ntsü mwɛy. Kyakin nde nswɛn yatɛy mukabel atɔŋ ande, <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>umpal kàtɛn nde naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">« Mɛ in'yàkyään làsaŋ a ikɔb angye akà atɔŋ amɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">mɛ in'kyer ayasyäŋà uboo a nköŋ. »<verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Nde kàtɛn sye naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">« Mɛ in'yàsà mpem amɛ amu nde. »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Waa kàfàkwɛy naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">« Le mɛ, mɛ anà baan kan'pɛ Nzam. »<verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Ntɔn baan abà bye anà undiir mwɛy wà un'tüüb, an'kil anà in'twaŋ, ifà imwɛy sye, Yɛsu kàbulà asànaa ba, nde kàbwäär ndür a imbuur. Abun, u mbwo a nkweel ande, nde kàkwaam ngwal a mbuur kàkäärà ukwà, iswaŋà naa Ileŋ. <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>U mbwo a ba, nde kàtsuuŋ baar banswà bàkäl uboo a isɔ u mɔ̈ɔ̈ aba wanswà ntɔn bɔɔmà a ukwà. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Ntɔn, nde kàyi anki mubay akyeey, wɛɛ nde kayi mubay ywar a Abàlam. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Kyakin, yàlɔ̈m naa nde ubulà asànaa atɔŋ ande unsà indiir byanswà, ntɔn mubulà undweer a angaŋ bàŋàyɔl a ngyɛb anà wàbalàbal unsà isal ande kusà a Nzam, ntɔn mudwa man'be a un'sɛŋ ande. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Apanà, nde kan'kwo mubay baar abàŋàsii, ntɔn nde ŋakwo bàkyer un'sii unsà mpay kàmɛn nde.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'söön Mɔsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Kyakin, atɔŋ in'kyɛɛl, bɛ baar làbye anà kab unsà làbeel a du, làsi an'kyän abe amu Yɛsu awà ntööm anà undweer a angaŋ a làkwikilà ifàkyään bi. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Nde wà lää akà mbuur kun'si, asànaa kàkäl Mɔsɛ, udu a ndwà a Nzam yanswà. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Yàmɛnà naa làkoo a Yɛsu làŋàsöön là Mɔsɛ, asànaa un'tööŋ a ndwà, we anà ibyääl aŋàsöön ndwà ya ŋakwo. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Abun, ndwà yanswà ye anà un'tööŋ aya, kyekà Nzam wà un'tööŋ a indiir byanswà. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Kyekà Mɔsɛ kàkäl un'syääl a lää u ndwà a Nzam yanswà, ntɔn mutà imbäl a indiir kàlàtɛn Nzam ungö. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Wɛɛ Klistɔ wà lää asànaa Mwan, kà un'tswe a ndwà a Nzam. Ndwà ande ya yà bi, isàkal naa bi ban'kaar kam anà làkyän amu nde abyà ifàswaŋ bi ngaal.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Duu a Nzam ntɔn aŋàlàkwikilà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Kyakin, asànaa utɛnà Dweelà In'kyɛɛl:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">« Ŋàbà, isàkal naa bɛ lan'wem ndaa ande,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>twon lan'bäm mpem abɛ asànaa utaaŋ bun'mbäär,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">ilä bun'sii u nsye ipɔl.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Akun ankaa abɛ ban'leŋ un'swey anà bàkyer an'sii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:9">itàkal naa ba bàkyàman isal kàkyer mɛ <verse eid="HEB 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>mbul an'kwem an'nà.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">Kyakin kàwem mɛ nkööl ayin nkyɛl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">waa mɛ kàtɛn naa: "mpem aba yàmubwà ndwaŋ taaŋ lanswà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">ba bàkwen anki muyöb undiir kàdilà mɛ akà ba."<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>"Kyakin, uboo a nkyɛl amɛ, mɛ kàdi kyän naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">Ba bàsàbilà anki kà ikal a ngyöör kàlɔ̈n mɛ ntɔn ba!" »<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Atɔŋ, làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ, wɛy akà umwɛy uboo a bɛ ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akal anà mpem a mbe mpa aye anà làkwikilà ayà ikun'syeenà mutɔn Nzam a mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Wɛɛ, ilä byanswà, làpɛɛl ngwal bɛ a bɛ, itàkal naa taaŋ mbɔɔn ban'kwo mutɛn naa « ŋàbawà », ntɔn akà umwɛy uboo a bɛ man'be màkɔ̈ɔ̈n un'kur musà mpem ande bwoor. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Kyakin bi ibàŋàtüüb a Klistɔ, isàkal naa bi kan'kaar tii u ntsüü, kam alà kun'si bi u nsɛmà.<verse eid="HEB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Kyakin, bàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">« Isàkal naa ŋàbawà bɛ lan'wem ndaa ande,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">twon lan'bäm mpem abɛ asànaa bàkyer ataaràbɛ umpal bun'pɛ ba ngö. »<verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Abun, bànà bàmbäär Nzam, ungö bàwem ba ndaa ande? Nkye kà baar banswà kàtwey Mɔsɛ u Ngipiti anki? <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Anà bànà nde kàwem nkyɛl mbul an'kwem an'nà? Nkye kà baar bàkyer man'be anki, waa bàkü u nsye ipɔl? <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Abun, bànà nde kàdyeel kyän, mutɛn naa: « Ba bàsàbilà anki kà ikäl a ngyöör kàlɔ̈n mɛ ntɔn ba. » Nkye kà akà baar bàtön mukun'kyey anki? <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Bi kan'man naa baar abà bàkwe anki mubilà kà ikal a ngyöör ntɔn ba bàkäl anki anà làkwikilà amu Nzam.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Abun, ntɔn ilää kàpɛ Nzam mubilà u ngyöör ande kyà kapaa, wɛy bi ikäl kà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn umwɛy uboo a bɛ ukɔ̈ɔ̈n asàkal u nsà. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Ntɔn bi sye, bi kàwɛl Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ asànaa ba. Wɛɛ ndaa bàwem ba yapɛ anki bweel, ntɔn umpal bàwem ba ya, ba bàsi anki làkwikilà amu ya. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Kyakin, bi baar kàsi làkwikilà, bi ibilà unsà ngyöör ayà kàtɛn nde naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">« Uboo a nkyɛl amɛ, mɛ kadi kyän naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">Ba bàsàbilà anki uboo a ngyöör amɛ! »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Nde kàtɛn abun, itàkal naa nde isal ande kàmay fà nkyeer a mɛɛn. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Ntɔn bàtɛn kà ikal mwɛy uboo a Ndaa Aŋàsɔn ntɔn ilä kyànsàmbwaar naa: « Nzam kàyöör kà ilä kyànsàmbwaar unsà isal ande byanswà. » <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Unsà ya bàfàtɛn naa: « Ndandaa ba bàsàbilà anki u ngyöör amɛ! » <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Yan'mɛnà ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa baar bumwɛy bàkyer abilà u ngyöör ayi. Kyeka, bàtàtwɛb bàwem Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ bàbilà anki mwo, ntɔn unkwɛɛm aba. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Kyakin, Nzam an'fàsà ilä asin ubeelà nde « ŋàbà ». Nde kàtɛn ntɔn kya ungöngö, u mbwo a David, unsà ndaa bàtäŋ kusà naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">« Ŋàbà, isàkal naa bɛ lan'wem ndaa ande,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">twon làn'bäm mpem abɛ. »<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Abà, yàlàkal naa Yɔswa kàpɛ ngyöör akà un'sɛŋ, Nzam kàlàfàtɛn anki, ungö a indiir abi, ntɔn ilä asin. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Abun, yàlàfàsaal ngyöör mwɛy, ngyöör a saba ntɔn un'sɛŋ a Nzam. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Ntɔn mbuur awà kàbilà u ngyöör ande, nde sye wàmuyöör unsà isal ande, asànaa Nzam kàyöör nde unsà kyànde. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Abun, wɛy bi idüül mubilà u ngyöör ayi, ntɔn akà mbuur mwɛy ukɔ̈ɔ̈n abwà unsà unkwɛɛm asànaa baar a Isàlɛl.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Ntɔn ndaa a Nzam ye anà mɔ̈ɔ̈, ya yà ngwal anà yan'söön kɔm lanswà u mpɔr. Ya ifàbilà tii kà ikal mukaab mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà dweelà, in'kwo anà usɔ. Nde afàsyeebà pànsi pànsi an'kyän a mpem a mbuur. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Akà ikyeer mwɛy ikwe anki mubaan kà ileer ande. Indiir byanswà byànsàpɔl anà byàŋàmɛɛy u mii a mbuur isàtääl bi in'lɔn.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu, undweer a angaŋ a dudu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Kyakin, ntɔn bi ibye anà undweer a angaŋ a dudu awà kàlyaaŋ u du, Yɛsu, Mwan a Nzam, wɛy bi ikäär ubwaŋàbwaŋ làkwikilà ifàkyään bi. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Abun, bi ibye anà undweer a angaŋ kan'kwo mukiwem ngyɛb ntɔn gyɔ̈ɔ̈là abi. Nde bàkyer un'lwab ndaa amu indiir byanswà asànaa bi, wɛɛ nde man'be kàsàkyer anki. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Abun, wɛy bi isin anà kam anà làkyän tsütsü a kir a imwol a kab a ngway, ntɔn Nzam kiwem ngyɛb anà bi iwɛl kab a ngway kusà a nde ntɔn mukibay u taaŋ a taaŋ.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Undweer a ngaŋ wanswà bàfun'wal uboo a baar, bàfun'sɔɔl ntɔn musyääl Nzam ntɔn ubwaŋ a baar. Isal ande kyà mupà an'kab anà ibɔɔn ntɔn man'be. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Ntɔn nde ŋakwo sye we anà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là asànaa baar banswà, lalan nde wàŋàkwo muyöb baar mpa bàfàyöb anà bàfàbwà ndwaŋ. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Ntɔn gyɔ̈ɔ̈là alà, nde akyer apà ibɔɔn kà nà ntɔn man'be a un'sɛŋ mpɛl anki, wɛɛ ntɔn mànde ŋakwo sye. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Yumwɛy, mbuur ufàpɛɛl anki isal aki nde ŋakwo, kya bàfàwal u mbwo a làbeel a Nzam, asànaa yàkäl ya akà Alɔn.<verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Kyakin, itàkal Klistɔ kàsàpɛɛl anki nde ŋakwo làkoo mubulà undweer a angaŋ. Nde la kàwɛl akà mbuur awà kàtɛn a nde naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">« Ngye awà Mwan amɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">mɛ aman'bɔr ŋàbà. »<verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Ntsü yumwɛy, nde kàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">« Ngye awà ngaŋ a ipepey</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">unsà un'lwaŋ a Mɛlkisɛdɛk. »<verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Unsà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande u mɛɛn, Yɛsu kàsi ngyamàkà anà ndɔ̈ɔ̈m, anà in'kwɛŋ anà nsaaŋ, akà mbuur kàkwe mukun'tswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ unsà ukwà, ntɔn ya Nzam kàkyer un'wem ntɔn unkyeey ande. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Itàkal naa nde kàkäl Mwan a Nzam, u mbwo a mpay kàmɛn nde, nde kàlɔŋàkà unkyeey. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Abun, nde kàkɔlà wàŋàkwo, waa kàbulà isin a ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈ ipepey ntɔn baar banswà bàfun'kyey. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Kyakin, Nzam kun'si nde undweer a angaŋ uboo a un'lwaŋ a Mɛlkisɛdɛk.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igɔnsà muwɛy làkwikilà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Unsà ndaa ayi, bi ibye anà indiir mbɔɔn mutɛn, wɛɛ yà mpay mubaal ya, ntɔn bɛ làkyàbulà anà undäär muyöb. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Sɛmà itaan, bɛ làlàkal alɔɔŋ, wɛɛ bɛ lan'fàkal anà ngyal naa bàlalɔŋ indiir atàtwɛb byà ndaa a Nzam. Bɛ làkyàkɔlà kà ikal mukal anà ngyal a bɛɛl, akwànaa isaa a bwoor. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Mbuur awà u mun a bɛɛl tii mpalàbà, ukwe anki mulab an'kyän unsà ndaa a balàbal, ntɔn nde wà mwan un'kye. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Wɛɛ isaa a bwoor byà ntɔn andweer. U nsyääl aba, ba bàkyàsà nsɔ̈ɔ̈l aba unsà yàŋàbwaŋ anà yàmbe.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Kyakin, bi iwɛy an'lɔɔŋ a nsɛmà mà Klistɔ, bi ileŋ ma akwà man'kwo ntɔn andweer, ukɔɔn afurà unsà indiir a un'bään asànaa: mubuul mpem, muwɛy isal byàfàtwaal ukwà anà mukal anà làkwikilà amu Nzam, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>an'lɔɔŋ a ndüümà anà màsyeel an'kɔɔ, ngwiiyà a akü anà ntsüül a nsaŋ ipepey. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Ler ndaa iyàkyer bi, isàkal naa Nzam an'pà mbwo.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Ya ikwe anki naa baar abà bàwɛl pɛɛlà, bàwem ntsà a kab a du, bàtüüb a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl, <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>bàlɛɛr ndaa a Nzam yàŋàbwaŋ anà ngwal a mɛɛn amà isàyà, <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>anà bàkyàbwà, ba bàkwe anki mufàbuul mpem, ntɔn mufàfuur Mwan a Nzam u kulunsi ntɔn mbuul a mpem aba anà mukun'mɛɛy nswɛn u mii a baar.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Umpal ifànwà mɛɛn an'dà a mbul màfànɔ udu a ma mbalà mbɔɔn anà màfàtwey in'te a mfun ntɔn baar bàfàkɔn ma, ma ifàwal nsaak akà Nzam. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Wɛɛ, isàkal naa ma màfàtwey nà ibwiy a nsyɛɛnà anà mikyɛɛl, ndöŋ ama yatɛy, itaan tɛy bàkyer ayàküül ma anà bàyàsà ma mbaa. <verse eid="HEB 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Wɛɛ akà bɛ, nkween amɛ, itàkal naa bi kan'tɛn abwɛy, bi kan'sà kam naa bɛ làbà u ntsü aŋàbwaŋ, ntsü a ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Ntɔn, Nzam wà balàbal. Nde ufàdiimà anki isal abɛ anà ukwen làswɛŋ bɛ ntɔn ikɔb ande umpal làsyääl bɛ aŋin'kyɛɛl anà làfàlab bɛ mukasyääl. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Wɛɛ, ngyal abi yà naa mbuur mbuur uboo a bɛ uswɛŋ mbämà nsil ya tii u ntsüü, ntɔn làkyän abɛ làkwe ubwaŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Abun, twon lan'kwaam ngwal abɛ, wɛɛ làyweel baar abà u mbwo a làkwikilà unsà mukwüünà, anà bàwal kwal a ilää kàpɛ Nzam.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiin ilää a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Umpal kàpɛ Nzam Abàlam ilää, nde kàdi kyän u mbwo a nde ŋàkwo, ntɔn mbuur aŋàsöön nde kàkäl anki. <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>Nde kàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 6:14">« Ndandaa, mɛ in'sayööl a nsaak anà in'sapà in'lwaaŋ a baar mbɔɔn! »<verse eid="HEB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Kyakin, Abàlam kàdil unsà muküünà, waa kàwɛl undiir kun'pɛ Nzam ilää. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Kyekà, baar bàfàdyà kyän bàfàkyer kà ikɔb a mbuur aŋàsöön ba ŋakwo, anà mumay mbaaŋ yanswà, ba bàfàdüül musà mbɔ̈ɔ̈l a kyän. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Abun, Nzam kàkwen muswaŋ ubwaŋàbwaŋ akà aŋakwal a ilää naa an'kyän ande ifàsɔɔmà anki, kyakin kàmɛɛy nde kya u mbwo a kyän. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Abun, bye anà indiir byeel mpa byàfàsɔɔmà, u mbwo a bya, ikwe anki akà ikikye naa Nzam utɛ loor. Bya byàmitwääl ndɛɛl yàngwal, akà bi baar kàwɛy indiir byanswà ntɔn mukaar làkyän alà biböön. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Akà bi, làkyän là asànaa löŋ a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi, làngwal anà làŋàbäm ubwaŋ, la làfàbilà ungö a rido, <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>ikal kàbilà Yɛsu kusà a bi ntɔn bi. Nde kàbulà undweer a angaŋ wà mbul a in'tye kà un'lwaaŋ a Mɛlkisɛdɛk.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlkisɛdɛk, mfum anà ngaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Mɛlkisɛdɛk awà kàkäl mfum a Salɛm anà ngaŋ a Nzam a Dudu. Nde mbuur kàkàbwey anà Abàlam, umpal kàfü Abàlam ità u ntsü kàwɛl nde iböŋ udu a amfum, waa kun'si an'kɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Abàlam kun'pɛ mwɛy unsà indiir kwem kàwɛl nde kà ità kàböŋ nde. Mutàsɛmà, ikɔb a Mɛlkisɛdɛk iswaŋà naa « mfum a balàbal ». Nde sye wà mfum a Salɛm, iswaŋà naa « mfum a duu ». <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Nde wà mbuur akɔ̈ɔ̈n taarànde, itàkal ngwän, itàkal un'lwaaŋ, itàkal nsɛmà, itàkal ntsüü a mɔ̈ɔ̈, wɛɛ nde wà asànaa Mwan a Nzam, nde wà ngaŋ ipepey.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Làtääŋ kölàköl a mbuur awà, waa undweer a mbuur Abàlam kun'pɛ mwɛy unsà kwem a indiir kàwɛl nde. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Kyekà, un'kɔɔn apaa nswɛɛŋ akà Alɛvi abà angaŋ muwal mwɛy unsà kwem akà un'sɛŋ a Isàlɛl, iswaŋà naa akà atɔŋ aba abà baar a ywar a Abàlam. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Wɛɛ Mɛlkisɛdɛk mbuur mpa kàkäl mbuur a ywar a Lɛvi, nde kàwɛl mwɛy unsà kwem akà Abàlam anà nde kàsi ŋilää an'kɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Kyekà, mukɔɔn asà mbaaŋ, mbuur awà udu afàsà mbuur awà ungyɛl an'kɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Kyekà, baar a ywar a Lɛvi bàfàwal mwɛy unsà kwem, ba bà baar akwà, wɛɛ Mɛlkisɛdɛk wà mbuur bàtɛ imbäl naa nde we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Mumay, bi ban'kwo mutɛn naa: Lɛvi mbuur afawalà mwɛy unsà kwem kàkyer apà mwɛy unsà kwem u mbwo a Abàlam. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Ntɔn, itàkal naa nde kàkäl aŋàtun'bɔr anki, nde kàkäl asànaa wà paa amu nkaa ande Abàlam, umpal kàbwey nde anà Mɛlkisɛdɛk.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Yàlàkal naa isal bàfàkölà u mbwo a ingaŋ a alɛvi, ntɔn kya kyà kiin a Un'kɔɔn bàpɛ akà un'sɛŋ, yàlàfàkal anki anà ndöŋ mutwey ngaŋ asin unsà un'lwaaŋ a Mɛlkisɛdɛk, akwànaa mukun'sɔɔl uboo a un'lwaaŋ a Alɔn. <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Ntɔn, nsɔɔmà a ingaŋ ifàtwaal nsɔɔmà a un'kɔɔn. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Wɛɛ indiir abi byanswà byàtɛɛnà ntɔn mbuur awà mbuur a mbil asin, uboo a ya akà mbuur mwɛy kàtàkyer anki ingaŋ u mɛsà a ibɔɔn. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Ntɔn bàkyàyöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa Mwol abi kàfü u mbil a Yuda, mbil mpa kàtɛn Mɔsɛ indiir ntɔn ingaŋ.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngaŋ asin asànaa Mɛlkisɛdɛk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Yan'mɛnà u leŋ naa we anà ngaŋ asin kàtoo asànaa Mɛlkisɛdɛk. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Nde kàbulà anki ngaŋ ntɔn nswɛɛŋ a un'kɔɔn a ikyee imbuur, wɛɛ u mbwo a ngwal a mɔ̈ɔ̈ mpa afàkwà. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Ntɔn bàtɛ imbäl ki ntɔn nde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">« Ngye awà ngaŋ ipepey</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">unsà un'lwaaŋ a Mɛlkisɛdɛk. »<verse eid="HEB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Abun, un'kɔɔn wàtàtwɛb bàkyàdwa, ntɔn wa kàkäl anki ngwal anà ndöŋ <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>anà kàsyen anki akà mbuur mwɛy u nköölà. Wɛɛ u ntsü yumwɛy làkyän aŋàsöön ubwaŋ làkyàyà. U mbwo a la, bi ifàsin tsütsü apà Nzam.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Apà làkäl anà kyän a Nzam. Baar bamwɛy bàbulà angaŋ ukɔɔn kyän a tub alà. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàbulà ngaŋ unsà kyän, mpal kàtɛn Nzam a nde naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">« Mwol kàdi kyän,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">nde usàsɔɔm anki ndaa ande:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">"Ngye awà ngaŋ a mbul a in'tye." »<verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Kyakin, Yɛsu kàbulà mbööl a nkwà aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="HEB 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Yumwɛy, angaŋ a alɛvi bàkäl mbɔɔn ntɔn ukwà bapɛɛ anki mbwo mukal ipepey unsà isal. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Wɛɛ, ntɔn Yɛsu wà mbul a in'tye, ingaŋ ande kyà ipepey. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Kyakin, nde kan'kwo mutswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ipepey baar bàfàsin tsütsü apà Nzam u mbwo a nde. Ntɔn nde we ana mɔ̈ɔ̈ taaŋ lanswà ntɔn muyamà ntɔn ba.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Yɛsu wà undweer a angaŋ awà kan'kwo anà bi, wàŋin'kyɛɛl, twan latɛy, ube batɛy, wàŋàkaabà anà baar a man'be, bun'sɛɛn u dudu u du. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>Nde kà wà anki asànaa andweer a angaŋ bumwɛy bàfàpà ibɔɔn ilä byanswà, utàtwɛb ntɔn man'be aba ŋakwo, ungö ntɔn un'sɛŋ. Wɛɛ nde isal aki kàkyer ipepey mbalà mwɛy mupà nde ŋakwo. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Andweer a angaŋ abà bàfàsà Un'kɔɔn bà baar a gyɔ̈ɔ̈là. Wɛɛ ndaa a kyän bàtɛn ungö a un'kɔɔn yàsi Mwan mwɛy wàŋàkwo mbul a in'tye.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu, undweer a angaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Kyekà, le kiin a indiir itɛɛnà bi alà: Bi ibye anà undweer a angaŋ a tub awà, nde mbuur kàkàbwaay u kɔɔ ibaal a kir a imwol a làkoo a Nzam. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Nde wàmukyer ingaŋ ande kà idwà anà ntɛn a ndandaa kàkyer Mwol, wɛɛ mpa kàkyer mbuur.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Undweer a angaŋ bàfun'sà ntɔn mupà an'kab anà ibɔɔn akà Nzam. Abun, yà ndöŋ naa nde sye ukäl anà undiir mwɛy mupà. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Kya nde kàlàkal u mɛɛn, nde kàlàkal anki itàkal ngaŋ, ntɔn angaŋ bà paa, ba bàfàpà an'kab mulab nswɛɛŋ a Un'kɔɔn. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Wɛɛ ba, ingaŋ aba bàfàkyer uboo a idwà akyà ikwom, munii a idwà a ndandaa akyà u du, asànaa nswɛɛŋ a Nzam kàwɛl Mɔsɛ ntɔn mutɔŋ ntɛn a nköŋ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 8:5">« Indiir byanswà ngye ayàkyer asànaa baswɛŋ bya u du a mɔŋ. »<verse eid="HEB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Wɛɛ apanà, Yɛsu kan'wal isal aŋàsöön ubwaŋ, ntɔn nde wà mfurbo a nkwà aŋàsöön ubwaŋ, yan'bwaay udu a ilää aŋàsöön ubwaŋ. <verse eid="HEB 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Ntɔn, yàlàkal naa nkwà atàtwɛb yàkäl anki anà an'pɛl, ndöŋ yàlàkal anki mukiir yàyweel. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Kyekà, muswaŋ naa nkwà atàtwɛb ye anà an'pɛl, Nzam atɛɛnà a un'sɛŋ ande naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">« Ilä byàmuyà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">abyà in'yàdyà mɛ nkwà akün</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">anà un'sɛŋ a Isàlɛl anà wà Yudà.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>« Wɛɛ, ya isàkal anki asànaa nkwà kàdi mɛ anà ankaa aba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">mpal katɛ mɛ mpi u kɔɔ ntɔn mukatwey u Ngipiti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Ntɔn ba ŋakwo bàläm anki uboo a nkwà amɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">abun, mɛ sye wakapɛ ngö.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>« Ntɔn, le nkwà in'sàdyà mɛ anà un'sɛŋ a Isàlɛl</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">ungö a ilä abin ayi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">mɛ in'sàsà in'kɔɔn amɛ unsà an'kyän aba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">mɛ in'sàsɔn mya u mpem aba:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Mɛ in'sàkal Nzam aba, ba bàsàkal un'sɛŋ amɛ.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy usàkal anki anà ndöŋ mukyään mbääb ande itàkal un'tɔŋ ande</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">mutɛn naa: "Un'yöb Mwol!"</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Ntɔn baar banswà bàkyer asan'yöb, sɛmà umbɛy tii akà undweer.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Ntɔn mɛ in'sàdwa nkul a ibii aba, mɛ in'fàsàyɔbà anki man'be aba. »<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Abun, Mwol kàbel nde nkwà ayi naa nkwà akün, iswaŋà naa yàtàtwɛb nde kàbuul undiir itaan. Kyekà, undiir usàbulà wà itaan anà usànün, wa wà tsütsü muyaalà.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Ngyamàkà a mɛɛn anà yà duu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Nkwà yàtàtwɛb yàkäl anà nswɛɛŋ ntɔn ngyamàkà anà idwà a mɛɛn. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Kyakin bàmbaar ntɛn mwɛy yàŋàkaab itiir byeel. Kyàtàtwɛb bàbeelà naa « ikal in'kyɛɛl », uboo byàkäl anà ikɔlà mutɔl mwinà, mɛsà anà mampà in'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Ungö a rido làyweel, kyàkäl itiir bàbeelà naa « ikal aŋàsöön in'kyɛɛl ». <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>Uboo kwo byàkäl mɛsà a wɔl ntɔn musà tswà mbaa anà un'böl a nkwà wàŋàbwää wanswà anà wɔl. Uboo awa làkäl làbuuŋ a wɔl uboo ala manɛ, anà unsɔk a Alɔn wàŋàfulà, anà an'tär a nkwà. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Udu a un'böl, bàkäl ikwom a bàshɛrubɛ a làkoo, munii a an'paab aba kàfafwe nkümà a un'böl awà bàfasyäälà ntɔn ndwääl a man'be. Wɛɛ, apanà kà taaŋ muyäm pànsi pànsi ntɔn indiir abi anki.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Ungö musà indiir byanswà abun, angaŋ bàfabilà taaŋ lanswà uboo a itiir kyàtàtwɛb ntɔn mukölà isal aba. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Wɛɛ, kà itiir kyàyweel, undweer a angaŋ mpɛl kàfabilà mbalà mwɛy u mbul mwɛy. Nde kàfasyeenà ibɔɔn an'kil ntɔn ibii ande ŋakwo anà byà un'sɛŋ. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Dweelà In'kyɛɛl wàmuswaŋ naa mbwo a idwà aŋàsöön in'kyɛɛl ŋàtàduub anki, isàkal naa ntɛn atàtwɛb yà kàpaa. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Kya kyà isii ntɔn taaŋ alà. Kya iswaŋà naa an'kab anà ibɔɔn bàfàpà kwo, màkwo anki mupɔŋ mpem a mbuur afàsà ngyamàkà a tub ayi. <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Ntɔn, bya byàkäl indiir iler udyà, unwà anà upɔŋ ndür. Ya yàkäl nswɛɛŋ a imbuur bàbwääy a ngwal tii utaaŋ a nkwà akün.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Kyekà, Klistɔ kàyi asànaa undweer a angaŋ ntɔn mukipà indiir kiwɛɛl nde u mbwo a ntɛn a kölàköl anà yàŋàkwo, ntɛn mpa bàtöŋ anà an'kɔɔ a baar, iswaŋà naa mpa ayà yà mɛɛn mà. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Nde kàbilà ipepey kà ikal aŋàsöön in'kyɛɛl, kà nà an'kil a ntab itàkal mà in'tö a ngɔɔmà anki, wɛɛ anà an'kil ande ŋakwo, waa kibeen mbalà mwɛy ipepey. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa an'kil a in'dim a ntab anà mà in'tö a ngɔɔmà anà isàkal naa un'twà a ngɔɔmà un'kyay bàfàtyaaŋ udu a baar a ŋingyäy màkyer afàkyɛɛl ntɔn mupöŋ ndür aba, <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>kamanà an'kil a Klistɔ, nde mbuur, u mbwo a dweelà a mbul a in'tye kàkääb nde ŋakwo akà Nzam asànaa ibɔɔn ikɔ̈ɔ̈n too, waa mpa isàpöŋ mpem a isal abi byàŋàkwà ntɔn musyääl Nzam a mɔ̈ɔ̈!<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Ntɔn ya, Klistɔ wà mfurbo a nkwà akün, ntɔn baar kàbeel Nzam bàwɛl kwal a mbul a in'tye alà kapɛ nde ilää. Ba ban'kwo muwal la, u mbwo a ukwà ande abà bàbeen baar bàkyer man'be unsà nkwà atàtwɛb.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Ntɔn ikal awà un'kaan a kwal, yà ubwaŋ bàmɛn naa un'söön awa akyàkwà. <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Ntɔn, wa afàbulà ndandaa ungö a ukwà a un'söön awa. Isàkal naa aŋawa we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈, wa ndöŋ ufàkal anki. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Kyakin, mpal yàsɛmà nkwà yàtàtwɛb, an'kil màkyer atyaŋà. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Umpal kàmay Mɔsɛ mukyään nswɛɛŋ yanswà akà un'sɛŋ wanswà asànaa ulɔɔmà Un'kɔɔn, nde kàwɛl an'kil a in'tö a ngɔɔmà, myà in'dim a ntab, anà an'dà, waa kàfwaaŋ ma udu a un'kaan a Un'kɔɔn anà udu a un'sɛŋ wanswà u mbwo a kɔkà a isɔp aŋàbäm in'kà a in'kɔk myàtsöö. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Nde kàtɛn naa: « Mà an'kil a nkwà kàdirà Nzam anà bɛ. » <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Nde kàfwaaŋ sye an'kil udu a ntɛn anà udu a indiir byanswà byà ngyamàkà. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Ntɔn, Un'kɔɔn atɛɛnà naa indiir byanswà bàkyer apöŋ anà an'kil. Isàkal naa an'kil ityaŋà anki, ndwääl a man'be sye yatɛy.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Isàkal yà ndöŋ naa indiir byàkäl isii a indiir a du byàlàpɔŋà abunà, abun, indiir a du byaŋakwo byàlàpɔŋà u mbwo a ibɔɔn byàŋàsöön ubwaŋ. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Ntɔn, Klistɔ kàbilà anki uboo a idwà bàkyer kà an'kɔɔ a baar, idwà akyà ikwom kyàndandaa, wɛɛ nde kàbilà u kiin a du, ntɔn nde umɛnà apanà kusà a Nzam ntɔn bi. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Kà ntɔn nde upɛ nde ŋakwo mbalà mbɔɔn anki, asànaa undweer a angaŋ kàfabilà nde mbul wanswà u idwà anà an'kil mpa amà mànde. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Kya yàlàkal abwɛy, Yɛsu kàlàman mpay mbalà mbɔɔn sɛmà un'bään a mɛɛn. Wɛɛ apanà, mbalà mwɛy ya mpɛl, u ntsüü a an'taaŋ, nde kàyàmɛnà ntɔn mudwa man'be u mbwo a ibɔɔn ande ŋakwo. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Mbuur wanswà akyer akwà mbalà mwɛy mpɛl, waa ungö nsaŋ iyà. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>Abun sye, Klistɔ kàpɛ nde ŋakwo mbalà mwɛy mpɛl ntɔn mubiiŋ man'be a un'kàbɔ a baar. Nde asàmɛnà mbalà yàyweel, kà ntɔn mulwom man'be anki, wɛɛ ntɔn mutwaal ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈ akà baar bun'dilà.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Un'kɔɔn we anà munii a indiir aŋàbwaŋ abyà iyàyà, wɛɛ kà isii a indiir a ndandaa anki. Kyakin wa ukwe anki akà ikikye musyen u nköölà baar bàfàsin apà Nzam: wa kàlàkwo aben anà ibɔɔn ifà imwɛy bàfàpà ipepey mbul anà mbul? <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Kya yàlàkal naa baar bàfàsà ngyamàkà ayi bàpɔŋà ipepey u mbalà mwɛy, ba bàlàfàkal anki anà an'kyän a man'be. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Wɛɛ, imɛnà naa u mbwo a ibɔɔn abi, bàfàfuur man'be kà an'kyän mbul wanswà. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Ntɔn, itàkal kà aben, an'kil a in'dim a ngɔɔmà anà mà in'dim a ntab ifàlwom anki man'be.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Kyakin, umpal kalàbilà nde u mɛɛn, Klistɔ kàtɛn a Nzam naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">« Ngye kàkwen anki ibɔɔn anà an'kab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">wɛɛ ngye kàbom ndür amɛ.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Ngye kàkyey anki ntsür aŋàfub</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:6">anà ibɔɔn ntɔn man'be.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Apan, mɛ kàtɛn naa: "Mɛ an'yà mɛ ŋakwo akà ngye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">ntɔn mukyer ukwen angye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">asànaa bàsön ya ntɔn mɛ unsà un'kaan ibaan a ntsür." »<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Nde waa utàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">« Ngye kàkwen anki ibɔɔn, an'kab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">ntsür aŋàfub,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">ibɔɔn ntɔn man'be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">bya ngye un'sak byapɛ anki. »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 10:8">Kyekà, ibɔɔn abi bàfàpà asànaa ulɔɔmà Un'kɔɔn. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Kyakin nde waa kàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:9">« Le, mɛ an'yà mɛ ŋakwo ntɔn mukyer ukwen angye. »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 10:9">Nde kàlwom ndaa yàtàtwɛb ntɔn musà yàyweel. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Yà unsà ukwen abà waa bi kàpɔŋà u mbwo a an'kab a ndür a Yɛsu Klistɔ, mbalà mwɛy ipepey. <verse eid="HEB 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Wɛy ngaŋ wanswà umbarà ilä byanswà ntɔn mukölà isal ande, mbalà mbɔɔn nde upɛ ibɔɔn nsil abin, abyà mpa byan'kwo akà ikikye mulwom man'be. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Wɛɛ akà Klistɔ, ungö mupà ibɔɔn mwɛy mpɛl ntɔn man'be, nde kàkyàbwaay ipepey u kɔɔ ibaal a Nzam. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Apanà nde wàmudilà kwo naa Nzam usi ayiiŋ ande ungyɛl a in'kɔl ande. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Abun, u mbwo a an'kab mwɛy amà mpɛl, nde kàbuul bàŋàkwo ipepey baar ufàpöŋ nde unsà man'be.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Apan, Dweelà In'kyɛɛl wàmukitɛɛlà imbäl sye. Ntɔn nde kàtàtɛn naa:<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>« Mwol kàtɛn naa: "Le nkwà in'sàdyà mɛ anà ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">ungö a ilä abin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Mɛ in'sàsɔn nswɛɛŋ amɛ u mpem aba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">mɛ in'sàbääb ya unsà an'kyän aba.<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Mɛ in'fàsàyɔbà anki man'be aba anà ibii aba. »<verse eid="HEB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Kyekà, ikal bàfàdwääl nkul a man'be, ndöŋ an'kab màfàkal anki ntɔn man'be.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làkwikilà anà nkääŋ a mpem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Kyakin atɔŋ, bi ibye anà nsaay mubilà kà ikal a in'kyɛɛl aŋàsöönà u mbwo a an'kil a ibɔɔn a Yɛsu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Apanà bi ibye anà mbwo akün anà yà mɔ̈ɔ̈ kiduub nde u rido, iswaŋà naa u mbwo a ndür ande. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Bi ibye anà undweer a angaŋ a kölàköl bàsi kà un'tswe a ndwà a Nzam. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>Abun, wɛy bi isin apà Nzam anà mpem a balàbal, wàŋàyɔl a làkwikilà, mpem aŋàpɔŋà unsà ibii kyanswà kyà an'kyän anà ndür aŋàsɔŋ a an'dà aŋàpɔŋà. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Wɛy bi ikäl bàŋàtsim unsà làkyän ifàkyään bi, ntɔn Nzam wà lää unsà ilää ande. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Wɛy bi ikyɛɛŋ bi a bi, ntɔn bi ipɛɛl ngyal akwen anà yàkyer isal aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Bi twon ban'tiin nköŋ abi, asànaa bàyii baar bumwɛy. Wɛɛ, wɛy bi ipɛɛl ngwal, ntɔn bɛ làkimanà naa Ilä a Mwol kyàmusin.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa bi ibàmukyer man'be a kɔrà ungö muyöb ndandaa, ibɔɔn kyan'kwo mulwom man'be ifàkal anki. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>Wɛɛ yan'saal nà mudil u bɔɔmà nsaŋ anà un'fur a mbaa isàkwiiy baar a un'tswe ngwal. <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Mbuur usàbɛy Un'kɔɔn a Mɔsɛ bàkyer un'dwa ukɔɔn ngyɛb, isàkal naa baar abɔ̈ɔ̈l itàkal atär ban'tà imbäl ntɔn ube ande. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Bɛ làsii naa ntaaŋàmbar akölàköl nà mpa kan'kwo muwal mbuur afàdyà Mwan a Nzam un'siinà, afàbɛy an'kil a nkwà u mbwo a ma kàpɔŋà nde anà afàto Dweelà a kab a ngway? <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Ntɔn bi ikyun'yöb mbuur awà kàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">« Mɛ in'sàfuur ube udu ube, mɛ in'sàfur mbuur mbuur ntɔn isal ande! »</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">Waa kàfàtɛn sye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">« Mwol asàtɛn nsaŋ a un'sɛŋ ande. »<verse eid="HEB 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Yà ndaa a bɔɔmà mbɔɔn mubwà kà an'kɔɔ a Nzam a mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Wɛɛ làyɔbà ilä abe byàtàtwɛb mpal làwɛl bɛ pɛɛlà a Nzam: bɛ làkyey muman mpay anwaan ngwiy a ngwal. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Mpal mwɛy bàlatö anà bàlamɛɛy nkwaaŋ u mii a baar, mpal yumwɛy bɛ làmɛnà mpay mbwo mwɛy anà baar bàkäl u mpay a tub ayi. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Inye, bɛ làwɛl kab unsà mpay a baar a bɔlokà anà bɛ làkyer akyey unsà un'sak naa bàgyɔɔr indiir abɛ, ntɔn bɛ làkyàyöb naa bɛ làbye anà un'naaŋ aŋàsöön ubwaŋ awà afàlam. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Abun, twon lan'piy làkyän abɛ, ntɔn la làfàtwaal bweel a kölàköl. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Ntɔn, bɛ làbye anà ndöŋ a muküünà ntɔn naa, ungö mukölà ukwen a Nzam, bɛ làwɛl indiir kàpɛ nde ilää. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Ntɔn, bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">« Lan'sal taaŋ ikikye, ikikye mpɛl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">mbuur awà ayà, akyer ayàyà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">nde uyàkyer anki itaan.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Apan, mbuur awà balàbal kusà amɛ asàkal wàmɔ̈ɔ̈ u mbwo a làkwikilà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">wɛɛ isàkal naa nde an'furà ngö, mɛ in'sàkal anki anà un'sak amu nde. »<verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Bi, bi kà ibà baar afurà ngö anki ntɔn mukàdiimà, wɛɛ bi ibà baar a làkwikilà ntɔn muwà mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Làkwikilà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Làkwikilà là kam mukal anà undiir awà unsà làkyän, mbwo muyöb ndandaa a undiir mpa bàfàman. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>U mbwo a la, andweer bàwɛl imbäl aŋàbwaŋ.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, bi ikyàyöb naa mɛɛn manswà màŋàyöŋà u mbwo a ndaa a Nzam, abun, indiir byàfàmɛnà u mii byàfàfà unsà indiir mpa byàfàmɛnà.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, Abɛl kàpɛ ibɔɔn aŋàbwaŋ akà Nzam kyàŋàsöön kyà Kayin. Ntɔn kya, Nzam kun'twey wàbalàbal, anà kun'tɛɛl imbäl nde ŋakwo ntɔn an'kab ande. Ntɔn la, nde wàmutɛɛnà tii ŋàbà itàkal naa nde kàkyàkwà.<verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, Ɛnɔk bàkyer un'swaam ntɔn nde ukɔ̈ɔ̈n aman ukwà. Bàfàfun'man anki, ntɔn Nzam kàkyer un'swaam. Kusà a nswaam ande, nde kàwɛl imbäl naa Nzam kàkyer un'kyey. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Kyekà, ukɔɔn làkwikilà, akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki mupà Nzam un'sak, ntɔn mbuur afàsin tsütsü apà Nzam, akyer asà làkwikilà naa Nde wà paa anà Nde afàpà làfur akà baar bàfun'leŋ. <verse eid="HEB 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, Nɔwà kàwem ngweey a Nzam ntɔn indiir mpa aŋàtàman. Nde ya kàwɛl anki asànaa un'tääm, waa kàtöŋ an'swà ntɔn ywar ande làwü mɔ̈ɔ̈. Abun, nde kàtsüül mɛɛn ntaaŋàmbar, waa kàbulà ŋakwal a balàbal làfàyà u mbwo a làkwikilà. <verse eid="HEB 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, Abàlam kàkyey làbeel a Nzam awà kun'swɛŋ mukyà nsi ayà kàlàkàwal nde kwal, nde kàkyen ukɔɔn ayöb naa nde ken ukyà. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, nde kàkàbwaay asànaa ungyey u mɛɛn a ilää. Nde kàbwaayà u ntɛn asànaa Isak anà Yakɔb sye, baar bàkäl unsà ilää nsil kya. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Ntɔn nde kàdilà bul làkäl anà in'bään a ngwal amyà kàyöŋà anà kàtöŋ Nzam ŋakwo.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà Saal, nde ŋakwo sye, itàkal naa mbul ande yàkäl yàŋàlyaaŋ, nde kàbulà wàŋàkwo mubɔr, ntɔn Nzam awà kàpɛ ilää aki wà wàlää. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Kyakin sye, fà akà mbuur mwɛy mpɛl, awà kàkäl aŋànün tsütsü mukwà, bàbör un'kàbɔ a baar asànaa mbwaar a du, asànaa an'sɛŋ a làbuŋ a ɛwà, mpa ban'kwo mutaŋ.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Yà unsà làkwikilà, baar abà banswà bàkü ukɔɔn awal indiir bapɛ ilää, wɛɛ ba bya bàmɛn mpɛl anà bàpɛ bya mbɔr ukwɛl. Anà ba bàyöb naa ba bà angyey anà alyaaŋ u mɛɛn. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Ntɔn, baar bàfàtɛn abwɛy, ba bàfàswaŋ ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa ba bàmuleŋ nsi. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Yàlàkal naa ba bàfàyɔbà anà nkyɛɛr nsi bàlwomà ba, ba bàlàwal ipöl mufurà kwo. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Kutɛn aŋàbwaŋ, ba bàkäl anà ngyal mukal anà nsi yan'söön ubwaŋ, iswaŋà naa nsi a Du. Kyakin, nswɛn yatɛy naa ba bàbeel Nzam naa Nzam aba ntɔn nde kalɔ̈ɔ̈n bul mwɛy.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, umpal bun'sii, Abàlam kàkäb Isak, mwan baal ande mwɛy mpɛl, asànaa ibɔɔn, nde mbuur kàwɛl ilää, <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>anà kàtɛn Nzam a nde naa:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:18">« Bɔr angye làsàkal làmbɔɔn u mbwo a Isak. »<verse eid="HEB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Nde kàmɛn naa Nzam we anà ikɔ̈b muwiiy un'kü, lalan Nzam kun'fuur nde mwan ande anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ asànaa kye anà ikɔk a ndaa, ndaa a ngwiiyà.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà sye, Isak kàsaak Yakɔb anà Isawu muyilà ndaa isàyà ungö.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, Yakɔb, kusà a nkweel ande, kàsaak baan a Yɔsɛfi umwɛy umwɛy. Nde kàtsüüm u nswɛŋ a unsɔk ande, waa kàkömà Nzam.<verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, Yɔsɛfi u ntsüü a mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande, kàkyään ntoo a baan a Isàlɛl anà kàpɛ nswɛɛŋ naa ba bàsàkyer aben ntɔn in'kwo ande.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, Mɔsɛ, ungö a mböör ande, aböör ande bun'yee ngɔn tär. Ntɔn bàmɛn ba ntwɛn a mwan aba, ba bàmɛn anki bɔɔmà mubɛy un'kɔɔn a mfum.<verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, Mɔsɛ, mpal kàbulà nde undweer, kàtön bun'beel mwan baal a mwan un'kaar a Falàwɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Nde kàkwen muman mpay mbwo mwɛy anà un'sɛŋ a Nzam, akwànaa mukal kà un'sak ntɔn taaŋ làmwɛy là man'be. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Nde kàmɛn naa muman nswɛn asànaa Klistɔ yà un'naaŋ aŋàsöön ntal akwànaa in'naaŋ a Ngipiti, ntɔn mii ande myàkäl muler bweel alà làyà.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, nde kàlwomà u Ngipiti ukɔɔn aman bɔɔmà a un'fur a nkyɛl a mfum. Nde kàkäl aŋàtsim asànaa nde kàmɛnà Nzam mpa bàfàman. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, nde kàswaal Pak anà kàswɛŋ musir an'kil kà ibeenà a ndwà ntɔn un'dwää ukɔ̈ɔ̈n aba baan abaal a nswɛm bà Isàlɛl.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, ba bàtsül ngyäl a wɛŋwɛŋ asànaa u mɛɛn aŋàyɔm. Wɛɛ umpal bàsii baar a Ngipiti mutsul, ba bàkyer aminà.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, ibä a Yɛlikɔ byàkyer abwà, ungö a un'sɛŋ muywolà bya ilä nsambwaar. <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, Rayab, un'kaar a pasàsɛ, kàkü anki anà baar mpa abà aŋàlàkwikilà, ntɔn nde kàwɛl aseey unsà ubwaŋ.<verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Ininà mɛ in'fàtɛn? Taaŋ làkyer ayan'kɔ̈ɔ̈n muyääm pànsi pànsi ntɔn Ngidyɔn, Barak, Samsɔn, Zeftɛ, David, Sàmwel anà aŋangɔɔm, <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>u mbwo a làkwikilà ba bàwɛl iböŋ udu a imwol mbɔɔn, bàsyääl balàbal unsà isal, bàwɛl indiir bapɛɛl ilää, bàdübà min a ngɔɔm, <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>bàdim ngwal a mbaa, bàsɔrà u mpɔr a an'kɔm, bàbulà aŋangwal ungö a gyɔ̈ɔ̈là, bàbulà aŋangwal unsà ità, bàbɔ̈ŋ aŋità angyey. <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>U mbwo a làkwikilà, akaar bàfàman akü aba u mbwo a ngwiiyà, waa bafuur abà.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Bamwɛy bamɛɛy nkwaaŋ. Ba bàkyer atɔn naa batsuuŋ, ntɔn ba bàwɛl ngwiiyà aŋàsöön ubwaŋ. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Bumwɛy bàkyer atoo, bakäm an'füm, babäm in'siŋ, waa batɔɔm u bɔlokà. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Bumwɛy sye bàkyer atà in'kul, batsütsül a si, badwä a kɔm. Ba bàkyer ayöö, bàbwäärà ibaan a in'kɔk itàkal ibaan a ntab. Ba batsüŋ indiir mbɔɔn, bamɛɛy nkwaaŋ, bapɛ mpay. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Ntɔn mɛɛn màfàkal anki ubwaŋ ntɔn ba. Ba bàbulà muyöö u nsye a ipɔl, u myɔŋ, uboo a mɔɔ anà u mfwoo a mɛɛn. <verse eid="HEB 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Ba banswà, isàkal naa ba bàwɛl imbäl aŋàbwaŋ ntɔn làkwikilà aba, wɛɛ ba bàsàwal anki indiir kapɛ Nzam ilää. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Ntɔn Nzam kàbön undiir aŋàsöön ntɔn bi, ba bàlàkɔlà anki bàŋàkwo ukɔɔn bi.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ntiin a muküünà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Akà bi sye, baar ibàŋàdiŋà a un'kàbɔ a ambäl, wɛy bi iwɔm undiir wanswà akapaa buur u dwaan abi, sin sin man'be màminääm mà, anà bi itsumà unsà muküünà ntiin bàmilɔ̈ɔ̈m. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Wɛy mii abi iler akà Yɛsu mpɛl, nde mbuur kàswaal làkwikilà anà afàkölà la. Nde kàtön un'sak kàkäl nde awà, waa kàkyey kulunsi ukɔɔn aman nswɛn a nkweel a tub ayi anà kàbwaay u kɔɔ ibaal a kir imwol a Nzam.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Inye, làyɔbà mbuur awà kàkäŋ mpem kusà a mbaaŋ a tub ayinà yà baar a man'be, ntɔn bɛ làkɔ̈ɔ̈n ayɔn anà làkɔ̈ɔ̈n akwamà. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Ntɔn ngwiy abɛ anà man'be, bɛ ŋàtànwaan anki tii an'kil ityaŋà. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Anà bɛ làkyàdiimà ndɛɛl kàlapɛ Nzam asànaa akà baan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">« Mwan amɛ, twon an'bɛy ngweey a Mwol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">twon an'kwaam ndür isàkal naa nde wàmukapɛlà.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Ntɔn Mwol afàweey mbuur ukwen nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:6">nde afàkam an'füm mwan wanswà ufàwal nde asànaa mwan ande. »<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Mpay làmànà bɛ yi yà ntɔn musuub bɛ. Nzam afàlawal asànaa baan. Nkye we anà mwan mpa ufun'weey taarànde? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Isàkal naa bɛ ntaaŋàmbar làfàwal anki asànaa bàfàwal baan banswà, iswaŋà naa bɛ làbà baan a mbɔ̈, kà baan a bɔr anki. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Bi bàkäl anà ataaràbi bàmɛɛn: ba bàfipaa ntaaŋàmbar anà bi ba bàfapaa làzir. Waa kamanà Taa a dweelà, nkye bi bun'wem anki ntɔn muwal mɔ̈ɔ̈? <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Ataaràbi bipɛɛ ntaaŋàmbar u taaŋ ikikye, asànaa bàkweenà ba ŋakwo. Wɛɛ Nzam afipà ntaaŋàmbar ntɔn ubwaŋ abi, ntɔn bi ikäl bàŋin'kyɛɛl asànaa Nde. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Mpal ifàwal bi ntaaŋàmbar, ya kà ifàkal un'sak anki u taaŋ alan, wɛɛ ngyɛb. Wɛɛ ungöngö, ya ifàtwey mbɛŋ a duu anà yàbalàbal akà baar bàfàwal ya.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nswɛɛŋ anà ngweey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Kyakin, làseen an'kɔɔ abɛ màŋàyɔn anà an'bwaaŋ abɛ màŋàkàkwɛɛr. <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Làböl myäy aswalaa ntɔn in'kɔl abɛ, ntɔn làkɔl ibweel làkɔ̈ɔ̈n abɔɔ, wɛɛ la làkɔɔrà.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Làkyer ngwal mukal unsà duu anà baar banswà, anà mukal unsà un'kyɛɛl. Ntɔn, un'kyɛɛl usàkɔɔn, mbuur mwɛy asàman Mwol watɛy. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Làkäl kà ikyɛɛŋ naa mbuur mwɛy ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akal u nsà a kab a ngway a Nzam, naa akà un'swɛy mwɛy wàbuul ukɔ̈ɔ̈n amɛn, ukɔ̈ɔ̈n ayɛl ntɔn mutwaal lingyoomà anà mutay baar mbɔɔn. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Làkäl kà ikyɛɛŋ naa akà aŋàŋingyäy mwɛy itàkal un'bɛɛy mwɛy ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akal, asànaa Isawu kàyälà nde inswɛm ande ntɔn bisaa. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Ntɔn, bɛ làkyàyöb naa ungö, umpal kàkwen nde muwal nsaak a taarànde, nde bàkyer un'piy, anà nde kàmɛn anki ipöl musɔɔm an'kyän a taarànde, itàkal naa nde ya kàleŋ anà nsaaŋ u mii.<verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Bɛ, bɛ làsin anki apà indiir ban'kwo muba, asànaa mɔŋ anà mbaa aŋàlɛɛmà, làpib, mpib, un'pöb a ngwal, <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>saay a mfuŋ anà làso a ndaa. Baar bàwem unkiiŋ awà, bàkwen anki mufàwem wa. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>Ntɔn ba bàkwe anki mukaŋ mpem ntɔn nswɛɛŋ yi: « Mbuur wanswà asàba mɔŋ, itàkal ntsür, bàsun'dwa a in'kul. » <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Ndaa ayi yàkäl yà bɔɔmà mbɔɔn, waa Mɔsɛ kàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:21">« Mɛ in'wà unsà bɔɔmà mbɔɔn anà matɛɛr! » <verse eid="HEB 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làkyàsin tsütsü apà mɔŋ a Siyɔnà anà apà bul a Nzam a mɔ̈ɔ̈, Yɛlusàlɛm a du, anà nsaab a nsaab a akyeey <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>abà kà un'kyɔm. Bɛ, bɛ làkyàsin apà nköŋ a baan a nswɛm, abà ikɔb aba byàŋàsɔn u du, yà Nzam, un'tsüül a nsaŋ a baar banswà, anà yà an'dweelà a baar a balàbal bàbulà bàŋàkwo. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Bɛ, bɛ làkyàsin apà Yɛsu, mfurbo a nkwà akün, anà yà an'kil ande màfàtɛn ubwaŋàbwaŋ màŋasöön mà Abɛl.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Làkäl kà ikyɛɛŋ, twon lan'tɔn muwem mbuur awà ayäämà anà bɛ. Ntɔn, isàkal naa ba bàsɔrà anki u ntaŋàmbar umpal bàtön ba muwem mbuur kàweeyà ba u mɛɛn, abun, bi sye isàsɔrà anki, isàkal naa bi, bi kan'pà ngö akà mbuur awà kiweeyà fà du. <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Nde mbuur kàni mɛɛn utaaŋ alanà u mbwo a ndaa ande, wàmupà ilää ki apanà: « U mbalà asin, mɛ in'yàfàni kà nà mɛɛn mpɛl anki, wɛɛ sye anà du. » <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Ngɔk yi, « umbalà a asin », ikyäänà ndiimà a indiir byanswà byàfànini u mɛɛn bàkyer, ntɔn waa isàsaal nà indiir mpa byàfàni.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Ntɔn bi ifàwal imwol mpa kyàfànini, wɛy bi ikäär kab a ngway alà. U mbwo a la, wɛy bi isyääl Nzam mukun'pà un'sak, unsà unkyeey anà bɔɔmà. <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>Ntɔn Nzam abi wà mbaa ifàkuuŋ.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Nswɛɛŋ ifà ifà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Làläb mukwen bɛ a bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Twon lan'diimà muwal baar ubwaŋ. Ntɔn ya, bàmbɔɔn bàwɛl akyeey ukɔɔn ayöb. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Làyɔbà baar abà u bɔlokà, asànaa bɛ làbà u bɔlokà sye anà ba. Làyɔbà baar abà unsà mpay, ntɔn bɛ sye làbye anà ndür asànaa ba.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Wɛy bɔr làkäl làlàkoo akà baar banswà anà mbiin ikɔ̈ɔ̈n akal udu a itäb, ntɔn Nzam asàtsul mbar a baar a inswem anà bà ipasàsɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Wɛy ukwen a ngim bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n abilà u nkääl abɛ, làkyey undiir làwà bɛ awa, ntɔn Nzam ŋakwo kàtɛn naa: « Mɛ insawɛy anki, mɛ in'sakɔɔb anki akà àkikye! » <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Kyakin, bi itɛn unsà kam lanswà naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">« Mwol wà un'baay amɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">mɛ bɔɔmà undiir mwɛy in'sàman anki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Ininà mbuur kan'kwo mukan'kyer? »<verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Làyɔbà baar bàlayaalà, bàlakyäänà ndaa a Nzam. Làyɔbà naa mɔ̈ɔ̈ aba kàkäl aben anà nkweel aba yàkäl aben, anà làyweel làkwikilà aba. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Yɛsu Klistɔ wà ifà imwɛy, yweenà, ŋàbà, anà mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Twon lan'pà mbwo naa an'lɔɔŋ ingyey mà ifà ifà màlabwiy ndwaŋ. Ntɔn yà ubwaŋ naa mpem ikäl ngwal u mbwo a kab a ngway, wɛɛ kà u mbwo a isaa mpa byàpɛ akà bweel mwɛy akà baar bàfàsyääl ya asànaa un'kɔɔn.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Bi ibye anà mɛsà a ibɔɔn, wɛɛ angaŋ bàfàsal uboo a idwà ikɔ̈b adyà isaa bàpɛ an'kab kyatɛy. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Ntɔn in'twaŋ a ntsür, ayà ufàsyen undweer a angaŋ an'kil amya uboo a idwà ntɔn ndwääl a man'be, mya bàfàfub u nsà a bul. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Kyakin Yɛsu sye kàkü u nsà a bul, ntɔn mubuul baar bàŋin'kyɛɛl u mbwo a an'kil ande ŋakwo. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Abun, bi ikyà u nsà a bul mukàbwey anà nde, anà mukyey musɛn un'tɛr a nswɛn kàmɛn nde. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Ntɔn u mɛɛn pà bi ibye anki anà bul ipepey, wɛɛ bi ibàmuleŋ bul làyàyà. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>U mbwo a Yɛsu, wɛy bi ipɛ akà Nzam, ukɔɔn ayɔn, nsyäŋà abi asànaa ibɔɔn, iswaŋà naa an'kab a ndaa ifàtoo u mun a baar bàfàsyäŋà ikɔb ande. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Twon lan'diimà mukyer ndaa aŋàbwaŋ anà mutà ibay, ntɔn ibɔɔn a tub abi byàfàpà Nzam un'sak.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Làkäl anà unkyeey akà antwasà abɛ, lapɛ làzir, ntɔn ba bàfàler mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ, ntɔn ba bàsàtal un'lɔn awa akà Nzam. Abun, ba ban'kwo musal anà un'sak, kà unsà uŋün anki, undiir mpa uyàkal u bweel abɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Làyamà ntɔn bi, ntɔn bi ibye anà kam mukal anà an'kyän aŋàpɔŋà anà bi ikwen mukal anà nkääl aŋàbwaŋ unsà indiir byanswà. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Mɛ amalàlɔm, làkyer ya apanà, ntɔn Nzam ukyer naa mɛ in'yàfurà agyägyä akà bɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyamàkà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Wɛy naa Nzam, awà ntwà a duu anà kàwiiy uboo a akü Mwol abi Yɛsu, awà kàbulà undweer a aseey a in'kɔk, u mbwo a an'kil a nkwà mwɛy yà mbul a in'tye, <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>wɛy nde kàlabuul bàŋàkwo mukyer yanswà yàŋàbwaŋ ntɔn mukyer ukwen ande, wɛy nde ukyer amu bi undiir ufàkyey nde, u mbwo a Yɛsu Klistɔ, akà nde làkoo làkäl mbul a in'tye. Wöwöö!<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr a ntsüü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Atɔŋ, mɛ amàlalɔm, làwem unsà nkääŋ a mpem ndaa a mpɛɛl a ngwal yi! Ntɔn mɛ amàlasöön ikökö. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Làyöb naa un'tɔŋ abi Tumàtɛ bàkyun'tsuuŋ. Isàkal naa nde kan'yà làgyägyä, mɛ in'yàlaler anà nde.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Lapɛ antwasà abɛ mbɔr anà aŋin'kyɛɛl banswà. Baar abà kà Itali bàmàlapà mbɔr.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Wɛy kab a ngway a Nzam làkäl anà bɛ banswà!<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
